#: 41e4246f0c0c48238031b7b66ac90659
msgid "Please note that the board will not enter DFU mode if the receiver is connected to either USART1/USART3/USART4). If you have it soldered there due to DMA requirements you will need to temporarily desolder the wire on the FC's RX pad and solder it back after flashing."
